Auto Ticket Classification using Flow Designer
4.Project Planning Phase
4.1 Project Activities
The project can be planned in the following stages:

Phase	Activity
1	Identify the ticket-classification problem
2	Gather functional requirements
3	Design classification rules
4	Design the Flow Designer workflow
5	Configure the flow
6	Test different ticket scenarios
7	Prepare project documentation
8	Demonstrate the completed project

4.2 Resources Required
Software
ServiceNow platform

Flow Designer

ServiceNow Incident/Ticket Management module

Web browser

Hardware
Computer or laptop

Internet connection

Human Resources
Project developer

Project guide/mentor

Tester or end user

4.3 Expected Timeline
A sample project schedule is:

Week	Work
Week 1	Brainstorming and problem identification
Week 2	Requirement analysis
Week 3	System and flow design
Week 4	Project planning and configuration
Week 5–6	Flow development
Week 7	Testing and debugging
Week 8	Documentation and demonstration
